OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy start, with rain soon
OL,6,Fmoving northeastwards to all areas.
OL,7,FOccasionally heavy rain from mid to
OL,8,Flate morning will ease during the
OL,9,Fafternoon, allowing some late
OL,10,Fbrightness. Winds strengthening again,
OL,11,Fwith strong and gusty winds by late
OL,12,Fafternoon.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FA mostly dry evening, with
OL,15,Fclear spells. Cloud thickening in the
OL,16,Fearly hours, with further occasionally
OL,17,Fheavy rain later in the night. Winds
OL,18,Fremaining strong overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
