OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FEarly rain soon clearing,
OL,6,Fthen a brighter day with sunny spells,
OL,7,Fmixed with isolated blustery showers,
OL,8,Fsome of which could be heavy. Winds
OL,9,Feasing later in the day.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FSunny
OL,12,Fspells Wednesday, with occasional
OL,13,Fshowers. Winds falling light. Foggy
OL,14,FThursday morning, with sunny spells
OL,15,Flater. Likely mostly dry with sunny
OL,16,Fspells Friday. Temperatures near
OL,17,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
